        <mxCell id="note" value="Current design: same Python process. The Streamlit UI imports the existing RAG modules directly; no HTTP API / FastAPI server is started.&#xa;The UI reads existing index, model files, passages, and evaluation CSVs without retraining or rerunning experiments." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="660" width="1125" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
